ARCHITECTURE kicom
COMPONENT chatgpt role="external reasoning/development cortex communicating through KCL"
COMPONENT https role="transport boundary"
COMPONENT kicom_core role="KCL parser, runtime policy enforcement, workspace, memory and deployment"
COMPONENT genome role="declarative desired-state DNA: lineage, invariants, components, hashes and health expectations"
COMPONENT phenotype role="currently running KiCom instance"
COMPONENT memory role="durable experiential and project knowledge; cannot grant runtime authority"
COMPONENT recovery_kernel role="standalone minimal recovery.php root-of-trust; does not depend on lib.php and is not auto-healed"
COMPONENT immune_system role="recursively compares non-state phenotype with trusted genome; detects component drift, unexpected executable/control artifacts and suspicious symlinks"
COMPONENT lkg_store role="protected Last-Known-Good copies plus a trusted backup of the genome"
COMPONENT quarantine role="protected non-web storage for divergent/unknown artifacts before reuse"
COMPONENT guardian role="autonomous immune controller: request preflight plus secret-authenticated cron, both limited to trusted reversible healing"
COMPONENT immune_preflight role="minimal recovery-based bootstrap loaded before lib/living on core requests; throttled, locked and maintenance-aware"
COMPONENT experience role="append-only structured event log used to identify repeated failures and guide future mutations"
COMPONENT insight_engine role="deterministic recurring-pattern analysis that turns experience into explicit hypotheses/suggested mutation goals"
COMPONENT evolution_lab role="protected, non-executable candidate package store"
COMPONENT fitness_engine role="deterministic non-executing checks for manifest, genome invariants, parent/generation lineage, mutation reason, syntax, privacy, static interface regression, kernel declaration and human-gate invariants"
COMPONENT self_update role="human-gated promotion mechanism for fit candidates and ordinary releases"
FLOW observe="phenotype -> immune scan -> genome comparison -> event log"
FLOW self_heal="request-or-cron -> throttle/lock -> drift -> trusted genome/LKG verification -> quarantine damaged copy -> atomic restore -> full rescan -> PHP parse verification -> event"
FLOW unknown="unexpected executable/control artifact -> recursive detect -> admin quarantine or Guardian automatic reversible quarantine -> event"
FLOW genome_recovery="current genome damaged -> trust pin selects LKG genome copy -> restore trusted genome -> continue diagnosis"
FLOW learning="experience -> insight engine -> explicit hypothesis/suggested action -> external reasoning cortex"
FLOW evolution="experience/insight -> external hypothesis/candidate -> protected non-executable candidate store -> fitness -> selection -> human promotion -> self-update -> healthcheck -> new trusted genome"
FLOW self_update="candidate/release -> manifest+genome verification -> backup -> write -> HTTP healthcheck -> genome trust promotion -> LKG build -> history"
FLOW self_update_failure="write/health/genome-promotion failure -> restore code snapshot -> restore prior genome trust -> history"
RULE "Genome, memory and phenotype are separate trust domains"
RULE "Autonomous healing may only restore bytes already trusted by the current genome/LKG"
RULE "Self-update and rollback hold a maintenance lock so legitimate mutation is not reverted by the immune system"
RULE "Parallel healing is serialized with a non-blocking lock"
RULE "Unknown executable/control artifacts outside protected runtime state are recursively detected; Guardian may only quarantine them reversibly, never trust or execute them"
RULE "New capabilities and security-policy changes remain human-gated"
RULE "Recovery kernel drift cannot be auto-healed by the normal organism"
RULE "Kernel changes require a genome kernel_revision increment and an additional human confirmation"
RULE "Genome lineage records parent, mutation reason, fitness evidence and promotion"
RULE "No unrestricted shell, SQL, filesystem-root or arbitrary remote-fetch capability"
DESIGN_GOAL "Living Architecture: self-describing, self-healing, experience-driven and controlled-evolution system with a small recovery root of trust"
COMPONENT human_control_plane role="attention-first human interface; health and decisions first, technical detail behind expert disclosure"
COMPONENT update_pull role="up to two human-configured HTTPS feed transports; package host must match feed host"
COMPONENT update_push role="authenticated direct package inbox; transport authentication never bypasses package verification"
FLOW redundant_update="admin-upload OR pull-primary/mirror OR authenticated-push -> single inbox/verifier -> risk classification -> backup -> install/decision -> healthcheck -> rollback if needed"
RULE "Transport redundancy never creates verifier redundancy: every channel converges on the same manifest, Genome, lineage, risk, backup and health policy"
RULE "Green updates may auto-install only when trust boundaries and security invariants are unchanged"
RULE "Yellow updates require one deliberate human action; red trust-boundary changes require explicit confirmation"
DESIGN_GOAL "Minimize routine human cognitive load while preserving deliberate control over changes to authority and trust boundaries"
END_ARCHITECTURE kicom
